note hello_web.jc: the minimal jweb app from spec v1.2 section 3.
note Run it with: python3 jesun.py examples/hello_web.jc
note Then open http://localhost:8080/hello?name=Jesun

bring in "jweb"

to hello with request
    name is request["query"]["name"]
    if name is nothing then
        name is "stranger"
    give back "<h1>Hello, " + name + "!</h1>"

add_route with "GET /hello" and hello
serve with 8080
